  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Lodging a complaint",
     "texto": [
      "**Begrunnelse** is the explanation of the grounds. **Innsigelse** is a formal objection. **Vedlegg** is a document added to a letter or application.",
      "In a formal written submission, state which decision you are referring to, explain the reason and attach the relevant documentation."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Exception clauses",
     "texto": [
      "**Med mindre** means «unless» and introduces an exception: **Saken avsluttes ikke med mindre nye opplysninger kommer fram**.",
      "After **dersom** («if») and **med mindre**, the clause keeps the subject + verb order."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
